load @term/seed/structure/space/vector
  find vector-space

# A vector space, the concept: the space vectors live in, closed under addition and scaling by a field, the home of
# dimension and linear maps. The eight-dimensional real vector space carrying the octonions is the arena of the whole
# theory. The canonical form is in the structure folder; this concept file marks the vector space as the central object
# of the geometry layer.
form vector-space-concept
  link structure, like vector-space
